Subject: [PATCH] radxa: preserve scanout only for a guarded loader-logo handoff
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific diagnostic]

Requires the boot-medium artwork patch. Keep the normal removal path unless
the artwork succeeded and the mode, reservation, boot path and FDT pass
the handoff checks. This does not validate the Linux takeover.

--- a/board/radxa/zero3-rk3566/zero3-rk3566.c
+++ b/board/radxa/zero3-rk3566/zero3-rk3566.c
@@ -4,6 +4,33 @@
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
 #include <adc.h>
 #include <env.h>
+
